NOTE ON THE UNDERLYING DOCUMENTS

The decisions, mediation cases, judgments and statutes that these tables are drawn from are
public documents of Korean state bodies. Under article 7 of the Korean Copyright Act, the
rulings and decisions of courts and administrative bodies are not subject to copyright
protection. This licence therefore applies to the compilation, not to the source documents,
which are free of copyright in the first place.

NO WARRANTY

The tables are extracted programmatically and are not guaranteed to be accurate or complete.
They cover only documents that have been published; many respondents are anonymised by the
Commission, so counts are a floor rather than a census. Verify against the original document —
linked in the last column of each table — before relying on any individual case.
